Package: finalproject
Title: Statistical Analysis of Public Health Outcomes
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yufei",
           family = "Chen",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yufeichen@hsph.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1825-0097"))
Description: This package investigates public health outcomes using NHANES
    and CDC waterborne disease outbreak data. It examines the association
    between BMI and systolic blood pressure among adults aged 40 and older
    using linear and spline regression. It also investigates the relationship
    between water system type and outbreak size using Poisson and negative
    binomial regression. The project emphasizes data visualization,
    statistical modeling, and reproducible analysis.
